        {
          "id": "7af4dc33-91d0-38fc-83f1-e737148faba9",
          "content": {
            "id": "7af4dc33-91d0-38fc-83f1-e737148faba9",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Should you invest in bitcoin or a crypto treasury company?: Strive CEO weighs in",
            "description": "<p>A major crypto merger is in the works between Strive (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ASST\">ASST</a>) and Semler Scientific (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SMLR\">SMLR</a>) to form a bitcoin treasury company with 10,000 bitcoin (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BTC-USD\">BTC-USD</a>) on the balance sheet.</p>\n<p>Strive CEO Matt Cole sits down with host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> explain the difference between investing in a cryptocurrency or a crypto treasury company, while addressing Wall Street criticisms of this portion of the crypto landscape.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "A major crypto merger is in the works between Strive (ASST) and Semler Scientific (SMLR) to form a bitcoin treasury company with 10,000 bitcoin (BTC-USD) on the balance sheet. Strive CEO Matt Cole sits down with host Josh Lipton explain the difference between investing in a cryptocurrency or a crypto treasury company, while addressing Wall Street criticisms of this portion of the crypto landscape. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Domination.",
